ore\nEvery mile becomes a memory\nAnd I just want a little more\n\n[Chorus]\nRun with me into the sunlight\nLeave the shadows far behind\nWe don't need to know tomorrow\nTonight the whole world feels alive","full",0,"yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors",0,false,"keep",120,"nearest_key_safe","dpm_2","sgm_uniform","none",1,1,"original",0,0],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"Upbeat indie pop with warm female vocals, bright electric guitars, punchy drums, melodic bass, and subtle synth layers. Catchy and energetic, with an uplifting summer atmosphere, a memorable chorus, and polished modern production.","value_1":"[Verse]\nMorning light across the window\nCity waking down below\nI can hear the streets are calling\nFeels like somewhere we should go\n\n[Chorus]\nRun with me into the sunlight\nLeave the shadows far behind\nWe don't need to know tomorrow\nTonight the whole world feels alive\n\n[Verse]\nRadio playing through the open door\nLaughing like we did before\nEvery mile becomes a memory\nAnd I just want a little more\n\n[Chorus]\nRun with me into the sunlight\nLeave the shadows far behind\nWe don't need to know tomorrow\nTonight the whole world feels alive","mode":"full","seed":0,"ckpt_name":"yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors","memory_budget_gib":0,"offload_ar":false,"tempo_mode":"keep","bpm":120,"mode_1":"nearest_key_safe","sampler_name":"dpm_2","scheduler":"sgm_uniform","ar_strength":1,"nar_strength":1,"target_voice":"original","semitones":0,"adapter":"none","vocal_manual_semitones":0}},{"id":41,"type":"YuE2MemoryPreset","pos":[1437.5492294305977,344.5732806042232],"size":[392.5299420949333,118],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"vram","name":"vram","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"vram"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"memory_budget_gib","name":"memory_budget_gib","type":"INT","links":[84]},{"localized_name":"offload_ar","name":"offload_ar","type":"BOOLEAN","links":[85]},{"localized_name":"vae_decode","name":"vae_decode","type":"STRING","links":[]},{"localized_name":"vae_tile_frames","name":"vae_tile_frames","type":"INT","links":[]}],"title":"Optional GPU Memory Preset (Native + Legacy)","properties":{"aux_id":"ScryptHunter/ComfyUI-YuE2","ver":"a547d60115e22b7c3d114210cd019b4918b4cb6d","Node name for S&R":"YuE2MemoryPreset","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"vram":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["48 GB"],"widgets_values_named":{"vram":"48 GB"}},{"id":50,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[751.9158885704451,-264.80033615271253],"size":[618.4700718197477,965.1979273617841],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["# YuE2: Text to Music\n\nCreates an editable ABC plan from Style and Lyrics, applies score edits, then generates audio. ABC planning is always enabled; the final score determines the automatic duration ceiling.\n\n- **Mode:** `full` uses a fuller melody/harmony plan; `melody` focuses on melody.\n- **Tempo Mode:** `keep` preserves tempo; `override` sets each tempo field to BPM; `multiplier` scales each source tempo.\n- **Vocal Mode:** `nearest_key_safe`, `nearest_octave`, or `manual`. Manual changes only the vocal ABC.\n- **Target Voice:** pitch range only. Describe vocal gender and timbre in **Style**.\n- **Transpose Semitones (Whole Score)** changes all score parts; **Vocal Manual Semitones** changes only the vocal line.\n- **Adapter (LoRA / LoKr):** Universal Adapter with independent AR / NAR strength.\n- Recommended sampler: `dpm_2` + `sgm_uniform`. Duration budget is a ceiling, not a target.\n\n\n## Style vs Lyrics\nStyle describes genre, instruments, vocal character, language, intended tempo, and production details. Lyrics contains actual words to sing and section tags such as [Verse], [Chorus], [Bridge], and [Instrumental]. Put directions such as deep witch house drums and huge reverb in Style, not as bracketed Lyrics lines.\n\n## Tempo and duration\nStyle BPM is soft conditioning guidance. Tempo Mode = keep preserves the BPM generated in ABC; the BPM input is ignored. Tempo Mode = override sets an exact BPM. Analyzer displays the final ABC BPM. AR LoRA can influence the initial ABC tempo through planning. Auto Duration is a hard ceiling, not a target: YuE2 may end earlier via MUSIC_END/EOS. Cover/remix with a supplied long ABC may follow a longer structure than unconstrained Text-to-Song.\n\n## LoRA\nAR strength affects symbolic/semantic planning, structure, and potentially tempo or ending; NAR strength affects acoustic/style realization. An FL joint AR checkpoint may reference a paired NAR through acoustic_adapter. If that required companion is missing, loading stops with an error instead of silently using AR-only. For A/B diagnosis compare Base, NAR-only, AR-only, and Joint.\n\nCheckpoint: [yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE/resolve/main/checkpoints/yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors)."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# YuE2: Text to Music\n\nCreates an editable ABC plan from Style and Lyrics, applies score edits, then generates audio. ABC planning is always enabled; the final score determines the automatic duration ceiling.\n\n- **Mode:** `full` uses a fuller melody/harmony plan; `melody` focuses on melody.\n- **Tempo Mode:** `keep` preserves tempo; `override` sets each tempo field to BPM; `multiplier` scales each source tempo.\n- **Vocal Mode:** `nearest_key_safe`, `nearest_octave`, or `manual`. Manual changes only the vocal ABC.\n- **Target Voice:** pitch range only. Describe vocal gender and timbre in **Style**.\n- **Transpose Semitones (Whole Score)** changes all score parts; **Vocal Manual Semitones** changes only the vocal line.\n- **Adapter (LoRA / LoKr):** Universal Adapter with independent AR / NAR strength.\n- Recommended sampler: `dpm_2` + `sgm_uniform`. Duration budget is a ceiling, not a target.\n\n\n## Style vs Lyrics\nStyle describes genre, instruments, vocal character, language, intended tempo, and production details. Lyrics contains actual words to sing and section tags such as [Verse], [Chorus], [Bridge], and [Instrumental]. Put directions such as deep witch house drums and huge reverb in Style, not as bracketed Lyrics lines.\n\n## Tempo and duration\nStyle BPM is soft conditioning guidance. Tempo Mode = keep preserves the BPM generated in ABC; the BPM input is ignored. Tempo Mode = override sets an exact BPM. Analyzer displays the final ABC BPM. AR LoRA can influence the initial ABC tempo through planning. Auto Duration is a hard ceiling, not a target: YuE2 may end earlier via MUSIC_END/EOS. Cover/remix with a supplied long ABC may follow a longer structure than unconstrained Text-to-Song.\n\n## LoRA\nAR strength affects symbolic/semantic planning, structure, and potentially tempo or ending; NAR strength affects acoustic/style realization. An FL joint AR checkpoint may reference a paired NAR through acoustic_adapter. If that required companion is missing, loading stops with an error instead of silently using AR-only. For A/B diagnosis compare Base, NAR-only, AR-only, and Joint.\n\nCheckpoint: [yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE/resolve/main/checkpoints/yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors)."},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":51,"type":"PrimitiveInt","pos":[1446.8706111892943,-395.40668143295244],"size":[378.42545413762696,82],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"value","name":"value","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"INT","name":"INT","type":"INT","links":[113]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.37.0","Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveInt","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"}},"widgets_values":[0,"randomize"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":0,"fixed":"randomize"}}],"links":[[84,41,0,33,5,"INT"],[85,41,1,33,